			"notes": "This is the very first Butterfly version, with only a few unfixes (mostly stuff from 1.12, since that's the stuff everyone is complaining about at the moment).\n\n### Unfixes added this release\n\n   - Water reduces light by 3 levels per block\n   - Dragon eggs break blocks when dropped in lazy chunks\n   - A 5x5 grid of loaded chunks load the centre chunk for entity processing\n   - Hoppers attempting to deposit items across chunk borders load the chunk they point into"
